WEBVTT

00:39:28.380 --> 00:39:30.006
within my band levels.

00:39:30.030 --> 00:39:32.396
And it was because I never asked.

00:39:32.420 --> 00:39:34.556
AG: Negotiation is an art.

00:39:34.580 --> 00:39:37.386
But there's a science
to help you get the results you want

00:39:37.410 --> 00:39:39.497
without hurting your reputation.

00:39:39.521 --> 00:39:42.523
(Music)

00:39:42.547 --> 00:39:44.826
WorkLife is hosted by me, Adam Grant.

00:39:44.850 --> 00:39:47.516
The show is produced by TED
with Transmitter Media.

00:39:47.540 --> 00:39:50.586
Our team includes Colin Helms,
