00:39:50.610 --> 00:39:53.396
Jessica Glazer, Grace Rubenstein,
Michelle Quint,

00:39:53.420 --> 00:39:55.536
Angela Chang and Anna Phelan.

00:39:55.560 --> 00:39:58.536
This episode was produced
by Constanza Gallardo.

00:39:58.560 --> 00:40:00.096
Our show is mixed by Rick Kwan.